## Original Content
L'astronaute française Sophie Adenot effectue sa deuxième sortie extra-véhiculaire, seulement une semaine après être devenue la première femme française à faire une sortie dans l'espace.

## Summary
Sophie Adenot, a French astronaut, completed her second spacewalk just one week after becoming the first French woman to perform a spacewalk. This achievement highlights her role in space exploration and adds to the history of women in aerospace.

## Key Points
- Sophie Adenot performed her second extravehicular activity (spacewalk) in space.
- She is the first French woman to undertake a spacewalk.
- The second spacewalk occurred only a week after her first, demonstrating rapid progression in her missions.


